1
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:16,950
When I was in the dark for the first time,

2
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:19,630
she was the one who gave me light.

3
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:22,160
Does it hurt?

4
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,600
She gave me a home.

5
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:26,230
Why are you

6
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:27,440
so weak, child?

7
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:28,970
People are bullying you,

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,600
and you don't even fight back.

9
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,280
If you encounter this again,

10
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:33,880
you need to scold them back,

11
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:34,790
got it?

12
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,240
I was afraid of causing you trouble.

13
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:41,710
You silly child.

14
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,710
You have a mom now.

15
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:45,990
Mom will teach you what to do.

16
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:47,520
Let's go.

17
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:49,980
Just now,

18
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,240
who bullied my child?

19
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,070
This child

20
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,740
stepped on my vegetables.

21
00:00:57,110 --> 00:00:58,920
I can pay for the vegetables
she stepped on.

22
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:00,320
But what do you mean by bullying her?

23
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:01,400
Zhang Wenying,

24
00:01:01,710 --> 00:01:02,670
you brought a child back all the way

25
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:04,150
from the Northwest.

26
00:01:04,150 --> 00:01:05,640
She's not even yours.

27
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:07,040
Is it really necessary?

28
00:01:07,150 --> 00:01:08,000
Exactly.

29
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,200
Listen up.

30
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,900
Her name is Chen Ying.

31
00:01:11,039 --> 00:01:12,120
Chen from Chen Fu,

32
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,520
Ying from Zhang Wenying.

33
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:16,230
She is my daughter with Chen Fu.

34
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,920
Now, the family that protects me

35
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:27,460
is about to fall into the abyss again.

36
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,460
I won't let anyone

37
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:37,550
[Copying]

38
00:01:36,229 --> 00:01:37,960
break this peace again.

39
00:03:04,590 --> 00:03:09,370
[LIGHT THE DARK]

40
00:03:10,230 --> 00:03:13,040
[Episode 3]

41
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,450
Hello everyone.

42
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,670
I'm Chen Ying.

43
00:03:54,870 --> 00:03:56,400
I'm here to report for duty.

44
00:04:02,130 --> 00:04:04,210
Once the weather gets hot,

45
00:04:04,470 --> 00:04:05,840
these buzzing things

46
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,030
are all coming out.

47
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,430
Let's see

48
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:12,280
if I can swat you to death.

49
00:04:19,269 --> 00:04:20,800
Where did you fly to?

50
00:04:22,270 --> 00:04:24,190
Where did you fly to?

51
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:28,120
Don't move.

52
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,060
Don't move.

53
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,290
Don't move.

54
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:36,950
You must not...

55
00:04:46,190 --> 00:04:47,210
Chief Sun.

56
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,500
Let me introduce you.

57
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:49,510
This is the factory administration's

58
00:04:49,510 --> 00:04:50,560
new arrival, Chen Ying,

59
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:51,490
the accountant.

60
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,220
Hello, Department Chief Sun.

61
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:55,430
I need to find you a seat.

62
00:04:55,430 --> 00:04:56,190
How about

63
00:04:56,530 --> 00:04:58,159
you sit opposite Qianqian for now,

64
00:04:58,159 --> 00:04:58,630
okay?

65
00:04:58,630 --> 00:04:59,270
Right.

66
00:04:59,630 --> 00:05:00,760
There's a seat here.

67
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:02,720
Okay.

68
00:05:03,190 --> 00:05:04,420
Thank you, Chief Sun.

69
00:05:04,510 --> 00:05:05,310
I'm leaving.

70
00:05:05,580 --> 00:05:06,780
Take care, Chief Sun.

71
00:05:09,270 --> 00:05:10,270
Is it fun to watch?

72
00:05:11,630 --> 00:05:13,280
Get back to work.

73
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,520
You must be Sun Qianqian.

74
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:23,460
Hello, I'm Chen Ying.

75
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:26,310
I worked at the grassroots level
for three years,

76
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:27,600
so I'm not very familiar

77
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,960
with this kind of work.

78
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,320
I heard you've always been

79
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:32,070
doing finance in the supply department,

80
00:05:32,070 --> 00:05:33,530
and you report directly to

81
00:05:33,530 --> 00:05:34,750
Department Chief Sun Jie.

82
00:05:34,750 --> 00:05:36,390
Next time you go to report,

83
00:05:36,420 --> 00:05:37,880
could you take me with you?

84
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,680
I want to observe and learn.

85
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,360
Learn?

86
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,870
Learning is good.

87
00:05:50,159 --> 00:05:51,659
I think...

88
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,730
Why don't you start learning

89
00:05:53,730 --> 00:05:55,190
from the most basic level?

90
00:05:55,430 --> 00:05:56,380
Go ahead.

91
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:58,010
Do these accounts properly.

92
00:05:58,920 --> 00:05:59,720
Okay.

93
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,480
Mr. Qi,

94
00:06:06,510 --> 00:06:08,570
who's that sleeping against the car?

95
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:10,800
That's...

96
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,720
um...

97
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,040
Wan Yang's brother-in-law,

98
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:13,830
Liu Jun.

99
00:06:16,270 --> 00:06:18,240
You understand everything

100
00:06:18,260 --> 00:06:19,520
I just told you, right?

101
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,680
If there's no problem,

102
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,560
come down with me.

103
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,480
Me, go down?

104
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:24,960
Don't worry.

105
00:06:25,270 --> 00:06:26,310
I'm the general manager

106
00:06:26,310 --> 00:06:27,240
here now.

107
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,680
And I've made a pledge

108
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,830
to Wan Yang.

109
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:30,630
If I were to send someone down,

110
00:06:30,630 --> 00:06:32,030
they won't say anything.

111
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,390
Yes.

112
00:06:33,710 --> 00:06:34,510
No.

113
00:06:35,159 --> 00:06:36,720
The thing is that everyone knows me here.

114
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,560
If I go down,

115
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,950
won't it alert them?

116
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,350
Then,

117
00:06:40,370 --> 00:06:41,630
I won't be able to see or hear

118
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:43,159
what I want to know.

119
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,070
That makes sense.

120
00:06:48,070 --> 00:06:48,930
How about this?

121
00:06:49,950 --> 00:06:51,830
I'll give you my badge.

122
00:06:51,870 --> 00:06:53,120
It'll be easier for you

123
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,070
to sneak in and out.

124
00:06:54,070 --> 00:06:55,159
Be careful.

125
00:06:56,190 --> 00:06:57,190
Thank you, Mr. Qi.

126
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,560
Be careful.

127
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,120
Is it loaded?

128
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:29,680
Yes.

129
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,120
Let's go.

130
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:30,680
Okay.

131
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:32,770
Let's go.

132
00:07:52,630 --> 00:07:53,600
Pair of twos.

133
00:07:53,950 --> 00:07:54,680
Two jokers.

134
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,250
You can't beat this, right?

135
00:07:59,290 --> 00:08:01,940
Come on, let's get to work.

136
00:08:02,290 --> 00:08:03,290
Stop, stop, stop.

137
00:08:05,770 --> 00:08:07,120
Thanks for your hard work, Jun.

138
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,240
You worked hard.

139
00:08:08,260 --> 00:08:09,060
It's nothing.

140
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,390
Hurry up and unload.

141
00:08:12,430 --> 00:08:13,480
Don't drop it.

142
00:08:15,750 --> 00:08:17,600
You'll get your share.

143
00:08:18,310 --> 00:08:20,160
We've worked together so many times.

144
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,510
Don't you trust me?

145
00:08:21,510 --> 00:08:22,240
Right?

146
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:23,630
It's not that I don't trust you.

147
00:08:23,630 --> 00:08:25,560
But business is business, you know?

148
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,540
Look at you.

149
00:08:26,630 --> 00:08:28,950
You're breaking my heart.

150
00:08:28,950 --> 00:08:30,540
Do you really need to count?

151
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:32,320
You're really counting?

152
00:08:32,549 --> 00:08:33,360
How about this?

153
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,630
After we unload the goods

154
00:08:34,630 --> 00:08:36,549
and finish the deal, let's have a drink

155
00:08:36,549 --> 00:08:38,480
and some late-night snacks, okay?

156
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:41,200
No problem.

157
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,960
Just by looking at it and I...

158
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:51,070
I heard your factory

159
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:52,960
is very strict lately.

160
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,170
I can't believe Jun

161
00:08:54,170 --> 00:08:56,150
still managed to get these things out.

162
00:08:56,150 --> 00:08:57,240
You have connections, don't you?

163
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,150
Who am I?

164
00:08:58,630 --> 00:08:59,980
The factory manager is my brother-in-law.

165
00:08:59,980 --> 00:09:01,520
The factory is my home.

166
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,510
I can take whatever I want.

167
00:09:03,510 --> 00:09:04,680
I can take

168
00:09:04,710 --> 00:09:06,120
whenever I want.

169
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:06,930
Alright?

170
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:08,200
You're the best.

171
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:11,300
The pipes you sold me before

172
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,670
were of really high quality.

173
00:09:12,670 --> 00:09:14,600
If you have more, get me some.

174
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,470
No problem.

175
00:09:16,150 --> 00:09:17,150
I'll look for them at home.

176
00:09:17,150 --> 00:09:17,840
If I have them,

177
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,500
I'll bring it to you next time.

178
00:09:21,550 --> 00:09:22,840
Thanks.

179
00:09:22,910 --> 00:09:24,040
Hurry up, everyone.

180
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,080
Hurry up.

181
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,510
I'll treat you to supper later.

182
00:09:26,510 --> 00:09:28,000
Okay.

183
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:29,960
Who is it?
Who?

184
00:09:31,150 --> 00:09:31,910
You guys,

185
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:32,790
go look around. Quick!

186
00:09:32,790 --> 00:09:33,480
Okay.

187
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,920
Hurry up.

188
00:09:37,270 --> 00:09:37,960
I'll go.

189
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,550
Two of you, go over there.

190
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:40,390
Okay.

191
00:09:40,750 --> 00:09:41,630
Up there.

192
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:44,290
Nothing here.

193
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:47,200
Anyone in there?

194
00:09:47,380 --> 00:09:48,360
Nothing here.

195
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:50,390
Nothing here either.

196
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,800
Nothing here either.

197
00:09:55,810 --> 00:09:57,010
Nothing here either.

198
00:09:58,910 --> 00:10:00,260
Nothing here either.

199
00:10:08,030 --> 00:10:08,630
Anything?

200
00:10:08,870 --> 00:10:09,790
No.

201
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:13,380
Jun.

202
00:10:13,410 --> 00:10:14,470
There are a lot of stray cats and dogs

203
00:10:14,470 --> 00:10:15,590
around here.

204
00:10:16,030 --> 00:10:17,120
Let's unload the goods quickly.

205
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:17,960
We'll have a few drinks later.

206
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,670
Don't delay our supper.

207
00:10:20,510 --> 00:10:21,970
Unload the goods quickly!

208
00:10:40,630 --> 00:10:42,750
The pipes you sold me before

209
00:10:42,750 --> 00:10:44,120
were of really high quality.

210
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,030
If you have more, get me some.

211
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,120
It seems this Liu Jun

212
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:49,670
is only capable of petty theft

213
00:10:49,670 --> 00:10:51,130
and can't do anything big.

214
00:10:52,390 --> 00:10:54,650
Wan Yang wouldn't trust people like him.

215
00:10:55,540 --> 00:10:56,760
Besides, Liu Jun pockets

216
00:10:56,760 --> 00:10:58,490
everything he steals.

217
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,960
It probably has nothing to do

218
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,800
with Wan Yang's corruption.

219
00:11:03,630 --> 00:11:05,360
Even if he has nothing to do
with the corruption,

220
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,080
he is still

221
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:07,280
Wan Yang's relative.

222
00:11:07,910 --> 00:11:08,970
Most importantly,

223
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,480
he's not very smart.

224
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,030
I think if we follow him,

225
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:15,160
we'll find some clues sooner or later.

226
00:11:16,910 --> 00:11:17,870
Ying, how is your investigation going

227
00:11:17,870 --> 00:11:19,330
in the Supply Department?

228
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:21,640
They are all on guard against me.

229
00:11:22,270 --> 00:11:23,150
It's okay.

230
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,840
I'll keep looking.

231
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,520
Eat more vegetables.

232
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,380
You know, the two women in that family

233
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:37,840
are quite wild.

234
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,870
Zhang Wenying produced that blueprint

235
00:11:39,870 --> 00:11:41,430
and blew up her husband.

236
00:11:41,510 --> 00:11:42,960
Blowing him up is one thing.

237
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:43,800
But

238
00:11:43,820 --> 00:11:46,200
we don’t have the year-end bonus.
Yeah.

239
00:11:46,630 --> 00:11:47,390
So annoying.

240
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:57,300
Has the broadcasting room moved?

241
00:11:58,750 --> 00:12:01,030
Why do you keep running
to the supply department

242
00:12:01,030 --> 00:12:03,560
instead of staying
in the broadcasting room?

243
00:12:03,750 --> 00:12:05,330
Is it any of your business?

244
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:09,240
You...

245
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:11,100
Are you friends with Sun Qianqian

246
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,300
because she is Sun Qianqian,

247
00:12:13,510 --> 00:12:14,440
or because she is

248
00:12:14,450 --> 00:12:16,120
Chief Sun Jie's younger sister?

249
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:18,120
Does it have anything to do with you?

250
00:12:23,630 --> 00:12:24,840
My mom was the director
of the design department

251
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,960
for over ten years.

252
00:12:27,550 --> 00:12:29,010
The projects she designed

253
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,440
saved the factory a lot of money.

254
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,370
Do you know that?

255
00:12:32,750 --> 00:12:33,750
Every bonus you received

256
00:12:33,750 --> 00:12:34,990
during the holidays,

257
00:12:36,270 --> 00:12:37,390
every benefit,

258
00:12:39,750 --> 00:12:41,410
and the lipstick in your hand,

259
00:12:42,750 --> 00:12:44,810
which of these isn't thanks to my mom?

260
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,200
Gossip about her?

261
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:49,710
You don't deserve to.

262
00:12:50,390 --> 00:12:51,240
Are you crazy?

263
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:53,370
My new lipstick!

264
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:55,240
Chen Ying, you have to pay for it.

265
00:12:57,550 --> 00:12:58,360
Director Zhang.

266
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,840
Given your health condition,

267
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,360
you need to be hospitalized for a checkup.

268
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:03,220
You can go home after the checkup.

269
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:05,150
But the investigation of the accident

270
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:06,600
is not completely over.

271
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:09,000
You still have to cooperate
with the superiors' investigation.

272
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,060
Do you understand?

273
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,440
I understand.

274
00:13:11,670 --> 00:13:12,390
Master.

275
00:13:13,510 --> 00:13:14,200
It's okay.

276
00:13:15,630 --> 00:13:16,550
Drink some water

277
00:13:16,550 --> 00:13:17,950
and moisten your throat.

278
00:13:30,390 --> 00:13:31,200
Qi Mo.

279
00:13:31,550 --> 00:13:33,040
Should I praise your loyalty

280
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:34,840
or scold you for being stubborn?

281
00:13:38,550 --> 00:13:40,080
I heard you are now

282
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:42,080
the leader of the restoration project.

283
00:13:42,080 --> 00:13:43,960
Don't come to me anymore then.

284
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:47,440
You are my Master.

285
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:50,030
It's only right for me to visit you.

286
00:13:50,030 --> 00:13:51,290
Listen to your Master.

287
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:52,960
You are a talent.

288
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,630
You need a bigger stage to show yourself.

289
00:13:54,630 --> 00:13:55,870
You can't act out of spite

290
00:13:55,870 --> 00:13:57,550
and bury your talent.

291
00:13:57,870 --> 00:13:58,510
Mom.

292
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,200
Mom.

293
00:14:00,870 --> 00:14:01,670
Mr. Qi.

294
00:14:02,630 --> 00:14:03,240
Mom.

295
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:03,830
We knew

296
00:14:03,860 --> 00:14:04,680
you were transferred to the hospital,

297
