Now?

586
00:27:55,880 --> 00:27:57,680
Boss, Mr. Qi is here.

587
00:27:59,490 --> 00:28:00,290
Director Wan.

588
00:28:14,730 --> 00:28:15,390
Nice rally.

589
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:16,680
Director Wan,

590
00:28:16,680 --> 00:28:17,920
you're really good at playing.

591
00:28:17,920 --> 00:28:19,970
It was too sudden
that you can't catch it, right?

592
00:28:19,970 --> 00:28:22,490
You probably need to practice more often.

593
00:28:23,910 --> 00:28:26,130
To take the director's seat today,

594
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,870
do you still need practice?

595
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:33,360
You used to be a maverick

596
00:28:33,360 --> 00:28:34,760
in the way you did things.

597
00:28:35,880 --> 00:28:37,600
I overlooked your talent.

598
00:28:38,680 --> 00:28:40,010
You got back at me

599
00:28:40,530 --> 00:28:41,840
with the design blueprints.

600
00:28:41,840 --> 00:28:43,290
Is it because I didn't

601
00:28:43,290 --> 00:28:44,490
promote you in time,

602
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:47,440
and you hold a grudge against me?

603
00:28:47,490 --> 00:28:48,890
You're overthinking it.

604
00:28:48,920 --> 00:28:50,320
I never thought that way.

605
00:28:50,840 --> 00:28:53,050
The reason I didn't rush to the front
in the past few years

606
00:28:53,050 --> 00:28:53,970
is that

607
00:28:54,120 --> 00:28:55,640
staying with my Master for so long

608
00:28:55,640 --> 00:28:56,970
has smoothed my temper.

609
00:28:57,010 --> 00:28:58,940
I'm not that competitive anymore.

610
00:28:59,250 --> 00:29:01,090
To be noticed this time,

611
00:29:01,440 --> 00:29:03,100
I'm already quite satisfied.

612
00:29:03,840 --> 00:29:04,890
Back and forth.

613
00:29:05,970 --> 00:29:07,440
That's the interesting part

614
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:08,770
of table tennis.

615
00:29:10,160 --> 00:29:12,960
You have to learn to observe
the opponent's serve.

616
00:29:13,730 --> 00:29:15,880
You also need to observe the direction,

617
00:29:15,880 --> 00:29:16,740
the trajectory

618
00:29:18,570 --> 00:29:19,970
and the power of the ball.

619
00:29:20,090 --> 00:29:21,120
Otherwise,

620
00:29:21,920 --> 00:29:23,360
you won't play well.

621
00:29:26,320 --> 00:29:33,040
[Party Member Activity Room]

622
00:29:26,880 --> 00:29:27,740
Think about it.

623
00:29:41,050 --> 00:29:41,770
It's time to take your medicine.

624
00:29:41,770 --> 00:29:43,430
I'll pour you a glass of water.

625
00:30:01,770 --> 00:30:03,200
Ying, I found the warehouse

626
00:30:03,200 --> 00:30:05,660
where they smuggle the factory's supplies.

627
00:30:10,440 --> 00:30:11,770
That Liu Jun

628
00:30:11,800 --> 00:30:13,390
really doesn't know his limits.

629
00:30:13,390 --> 00:30:14,940
I warned him yesterday.

630
00:30:14,970 --> 00:30:16,570
And he's still going too far.

631
00:30:16,680 --> 00:30:18,620
Someone is definitely playing tricks
this time.

632
00:30:18,620 --> 00:30:20,790
The Chen siblings must be involved.

633
00:30:21,010 --> 00:30:22,440
Do you need me to do anything?

634
00:30:22,440 --> 00:30:22,970
No.

635
00:30:23,320 --> 00:30:24,580
I'll handle it myself.

636
00:30:28,970 --> 00:30:29,970
Get out of the way.

637
00:30:33,440 --> 00:30:36,100
Hurry up and apologize
to your brother-in-law.

638
00:30:40,250 --> 00:30:41,690
Are you stupid?

639
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:43,050
Apologize to your brother-in-law.

640
00:30:43,050 --> 00:30:43,840
Sister.

641
00:30:44,290 --> 00:30:45,440
I told you to apologize
to your brother-in-law.

642
00:30:45,440 --> 00:30:46,360
Did you hear me?

643
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:49,440
Brother-in-law.

644
00:30:50,640 --> 00:30:51,450
I was wrong.

645
00:30:55,250 --> 00:30:57,750
Jun was ignorant this time.

646
00:30:57,770 --> 00:30:59,300
He won't dare to do it again.

647
00:30:59,920 --> 00:31:00,770
Wan.

648
00:31:01,290 --> 00:31:03,220
Can you make an exception? Please?

649
00:31:04,050 --> 00:31:05,580
I warned him a long time ago.

650
00:31:07,060 --> 00:31:08,330
Didn't I warn you?

651
00:31:09,880 --> 00:31:11,440
This time is different from before.

652
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:12,490
Chen Fu's matter

653
00:31:12,490 --> 00:31:14,530
has already prompted the city
to investigate.

654
00:31:14,530 --> 00:31:16,130
In this very turbulent time,

655
00:31:16,770 --> 00:31:18,770
he actually dared to cause trouble.

656
00:31:19,770 --> 00:31:21,630
I really want to kick you to death.

657
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:22,880
Liu Jun.

658
00:31:26,140 --> 00:31:28,290
-I told you not to do bad things!
-Sister! Sister!

659
00:31:28,290 --> 00:31:29,910
I told you not to do bad things.

660
00:31:29,910 --> 00:31:31,570
What good have you done?

661
00:31:31,900 --> 00:31:33,900
What did you do? Tell me.

662
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:34,380
Sister.

663
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:42,880
Chen Shan.

664
00:31:44,110 --> 00:31:45,430
Chen Shan, come here.

665
00:31:46,290 --> 00:31:47,950
Your mom is coming home today.

666
00:31:48,400 --> 00:31:49,680
So I won't go up.

667
00:31:49,840 --> 00:31:51,680
I have some documents for her.

668
00:31:54,640 --> 00:31:55,440
Kid.

669
00:31:56,010 --> 00:31:57,740
You'd better take a look first.

670
00:31:58,440 --> 00:31:59,240
Let's go.

671
00:32:20,050 --> 00:32:21,850
Shan isn't answering his phone.

672
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:23,200
Mom.

673
00:32:23,400 --> 00:32:24,570
Don't cook tonight.

674
00:32:24,570 --> 00:32:25,830
I'll go buy some dishes

675
00:32:25,840 --> 00:32:26,730
and see if Shan

676
00:32:26,730 --> 00:32:27,770
is nearby.

677
00:32:27,810 --> 00:32:29,400
Okay, go find him.

678
00:32:33,900 --> 00:32:34,900
Mom, I'm leaving.

679
00:33:03,810 --> 00:33:04,530
Shan.

680
00:33:04,530 --> 00:33:06,130
Why are you just coming back?

681
00:33:06,250 --> 00:33:08,110
Your sister went looking for you.

682
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:12,050
Mom.

683
00:33:13,360 --> 00:33:14,490
How did Ying's

684
00:33:14,490 --> 00:33:15,890
biological parents die?

685
00:33:20,010 --> 00:33:21,340
Why are you asking this?

686
00:33:21,680 --> 00:33:22,730
Did someone say something to you?

687
00:33:22,730 --> 00:33:23,400
Never mind that.

688
00:33:23,400 --> 00:33:24,400
Answer me first.

689
00:33:25,810 --> 00:33:27,680
How did her parents die?

690
00:33:30,620 --> 00:33:31,560
Shan.

691
00:33:33,090 --> 00:33:34,570
A lot happened in the past.

692
00:33:35,200 --> 00:33:36,920
I can't explain it all right now.

693
00:33:36,920 --> 00:33:38,200
Go find your sister first.

694
00:33:38,200 --> 00:33:39,530
When the time is right,

695
00:33:39,530 --> 00:33:40,970
I will tell you.

696
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:42,560
What are you hiding from?

697
00:33:43,490 --> 00:33:44,750
What are you afraid of?

698
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:48,160
How many more things

699
00:33:48,160 --> 00:33:49,490
are you keeping from us?

700
00:33:50,290 --> 00:33:51,550
You don't understand.

701
00:33:51,730 --> 00:33:52,840
I don't.

702
00:33:53,840 --> 00:33:54,770
I don't understand why

703
00:33:54,770 --> 00:33:56,050
you never tell us

704
00:33:56,050 --> 00:33:57,200
anything.

705
00:33:58,120 --> 00:33:59,890
That blueprint incident

706
00:34:00,490 --> 00:34:02,550
had nothing to do with you,

707
00:34:02,920 --> 00:34:03,570
yet you admitted to it

708
00:34:03,570 --> 00:34:04,920
so willingly.

709
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:07,160
Is it because

710
00:34:07,160 --> 00:34:08,239
Wan Yang helped you

711
00:34:08,239 --> 00:34:10,040
suppress this matter back then?

712
00:34:11,719 --> 00:34:14,120
You and Dad caused a construction accident

713
00:34:15,449 --> 00:34:17,710
that killed Ying's biological parents.

714
00:34:25,199 --> 00:34:25,889
Mom.

715
00:34:27,010 --> 00:34:27,530
Mom.

716
00:34:37,150 --> 00:34:39,400
Everything I just said

717
00:34:42,760 --> 00:34:44,280
is true, right?

718
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:57,540
You shouldn't have lied to her like this.

719
00:34:58,760 --> 00:34:59,490
Is it fair to her

720
00:34:59,490 --> 00:35:00,760
that you did this?

721
00:35:00,760 --> 00:35:01,570
Shan.

722
00:35:02,180 --> 00:35:03,660
Stop talking.

723
00:35:03,930 --> 00:35:04,890
Our family still

724
00:35:04,890 --> 00:35:07,600
-needs to be in tact.
-How?

725
00:35:09,730 --> 00:35:10,720
You...

726
00:35:10,750 --> 00:35:13,190
You and Dad have lied to her
for so many years.

727
00:35:13,190 --> 00:35:14,570
Am I supposed to play along

728
00:35:14,570 --> 00:35:16,090
and keep lying to her?

729
00:35:43,200 --> 00:35:44,760
It was you

730
00:35:47,640 --> 00:35:49,320
who've always told me

731
00:35:49,320 --> 00:35:51,140
since I was little

732
00:35:52,460 --> 00:35:55,700
to be honest and upright.

733
00:36:00,490 --> 00:36:02,160
I really don't know.

734
00:36:04,370 --> 00:36:05,530
Are you still the brave

735
00:36:05,530 --> 00:36:07,370
and upright mom?

736
00:36:10,870 --> 00:36:11,890
Are you still

737
00:36:11,890 --> 00:36:13,200
the female warrior,

738
00:36:13,200 --> 00:36:14,450
Zhang Wenying?

739
00:37:00,750 --> 00:37:02,030
Why are you here?

740
00:37:02,050 --> 00:37:03,300
I looked everywhere for you.

741
00:37:03,300 --> 00:37:05,100
You didn't even answer my calls.

742
00:37:05,300 --> 00:37:07,300
Mom has been waiting for you at home.

743
00:37:15,160 --> 00:37:16,200
I'm happy today

744
00:37:16,600 --> 00:37:17,660
so I wanted a drink.

745
00:37:19,350 --> 00:37:20,810
Mom was discharged today.

746
00:37:21,530 --> 00:37:22,660
So you can have some.

747
00:37:22,670 --> 00:37:23,840
She won't blame you.

748
00:37:27,370 --> 00:37:28,490
Let's go home.

749
00:37:51,680 --> 00:37:52,940
Go call Mom for dinner.

750
00:38:05,640 --> 00:38:06,600
Time to eat, Mom.

751
00:38:09,490 --> 00:38:10,760
Is she asleep?

752
00:38:12,890 --> 00:38:13,530
Mom.

753
00:38:19,850 --> 00:38:20,490
Mom.

754
00:38:40,640 --> 00:38:41,890
What's wrong, Shan?

755
00:38:45,150 --> 00:38:46,100
What's wrong?

756
00:38:52,640 --> 00:38:54,170
I, Zhang Wenying,

757
00:38:54,490 --> 00:38:56,180
have lived half my life.

758
00:38:56,410 --> 00:38:57,280
As for my work,

759
00:38:57,430 --> 00:38:58,470
my husband,

760
00:38:58,910 --> 00:39:00,110
and my children,

761
00:39:00,410 --> 00:39:02,340
I haven't handled any of them well.

762
00:39:03,070 --> 00:39:04,640
I have failed my family.

763
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:07,220
I have failed the organization
that trained me.

764
00:39:07,220 --> 00:39:08,890
I have failed this world.

765
00:39:10,050 --> 00:39:11,910
I hope to make amends in the next life

766
00:39:11,910 --> 00:39:13,310
to atone for my past sins.

767
00:39:20,280 --> 00:39:21,750
Zhang Wenying is dead.

768
00:39:21,890 --> 00:39:23,050
Will her two kids

769
00:39:23,050 --> 00:39:24,910
come to the plant to make trouble?

770
00:39:26,800 --> 00:39:29,330
Fledglings without
an old bird's protection

771
00:39:29,570 --> 00:39:31,010
are considered tough

772
00:39:32,280 --> 00:39:34,050
if they manage to flutter out of the nest.

773
00:39:34,050 --> 00:39:35,090
I'm just a little worried

774
00:39:35,090 --> 00:39:36,320
about Chen Ying.

775
00:39:36,800 --> 00:39:37,720
Ever since she arrived
at the supply department,

776
00:39:37,720 --> 00:39:38,920
she hasn't been idle.

777
00:39:39,050 --> 00:39:40,600
She's been asking around all day long

778
00:39:40,600 --> 00:39:41,370
and almost got her hands

779
00:39:41,370 --> 00:39:42,600
on the account book.

780
00:39:42,890 --> 00:39:45,200
If this continues, she'll be a problem
sooner or later.

781
00:39:45,200 --> 00:39:46,280
Do you think we need

782
00:39:46,280 --> 00:39:47,200
to transfer her to

783
00:39:47,200 --> 00:39:48,640
an unimportant department

784
00:39:48,640 --> 00:39:50,160
to avoid future trouble?

785
00:39:50,680 --> 00:39:51,850
Just kick her out.

786
00:39:53,280 --> 00:39:54,810
As for Chen Shan...

787
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:56,640
Zhang Wenying was a smart woman.

788
00:39:57,160 --> 00:39:59,220
But despite being smart all her life,

789
00:39:59,390 --> 00:40:01,420
she left her child

790
00:40:01,750 --> 00:40:03,490
a deadly problem in the end.

791
00:40:03,720 --> 00:40:05,340
What happened recently,

792
00:40:05,570 --> 00:40:06,680
you've seen it all.

793
00:40:07,690 --> 00:40:10,420
Some things are happening
faster than expected.

794
00:40:12,840 --> 00:40:14,770
I might have to change my approach.

795
00:40:15,180 --> 00:40:17,910
The most important thing
is a smooth transition.

796
00:40:18,910 --> 00:40:20,600
If I retire early,

797
00:40:20,850 --> 00:40:23,220
it won't be easy for you
in the plant either.

798
00:40:23,220 --> 00:40:24,950
Wherever you want to go by then,

799
00:40:25,200 --> 00:40:26,160
I'll arrange it.

800
00:40:27,370 --> 00:40:28,460
Thank you, chief.

801
00:40:28,490 --> 00:40:30,020
I'll do whatever you say.

802
00:40:45,450 --> 00:40:47,310
Zhang Wenying's death and you...

803
00:40:50,040 --> 00:40:51,920
Have you been so busy lately

804
00:40:51,940 --> 00:40:53,470
that you've lost your mind?

805
00:40:54,390 --> 00:40:56,250
You never used to ask about things

806
00:40:56,890 --> 00:40:58,160
I don't mention.

807
00:41:01,570 --> 00:41:02,630
I spoke out of turn.

808
00:41:21,630 --> 00:41:22,500
Wan Yang.

809
00:41:23,010 --> 00:41:24,870
I'm not done with you, you hear me?

810
00:41:25,450 --> 00:41:26,450
How dare you use that incident

811
00:41:26,450 --> 00:41:27,800
to threaten my son!

812
00:41:27,850 --> 00:41:29,890
Calm down.

813
00:41:29,920 --> 00:41:31,190
Chen is dead

814
00:41:31,210 --> 00:41:32,700
and I took the blame.

815
00:41:32,730 --> 00:41:34,980
And you still want to wipe us out?

816
00:41:35,010 --> 00:41:36,470
Then let's all go down together.

817
00:41:36,470 --> 00:41:37,320
I'm telling you,

818
00:41:37,320 --> 00:41:38,640
I'm turning myself in tomorrow.

819
00:41:38,640 --> 00:41:39,680
I will explain

820
00:41:39,680 --> 00:41:40,600
everything clearly.

821
00:41:40,600 --> 00:41:41,160
Wan Yang,

822
00:41:41,160 --> 00:41:42,320
just you wait!
